{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the grind</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, Craft, Kill. This is the path to the bottom. Dig for resources, craft powerful gear, kill enemies for loot and overcome bosses to be able to prestige, unlock permanent buffs and repeat. See how far you can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/38c14f0cb9abfd2e35d9c9e57d7131c9.avif?t=1769775461\" width=609 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five unique dig sites, each with different ores to mine for crafting better gear. Defeat dungeon bosses to unlock new locations, and spend gold dropped from monsters to regenerate dig sites for endless resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/a275664d2c424bed9be653ee40da87d8.poster.avif?t=1769775461\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/a275664d2c424bed9be653ee40da87d8.webm?t=1769775461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/a275664d2c424bed9be653ee40da87d8.mp4?t=1769775461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/69cb17f7bd2ddf94754914db6edd566a.avif?t=1769775461\" width=609 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge equipment and infuse it with stats and effects using items collected from dungeon monsters. Combine three items of the same tier into stronger gear (common, uncommon, epic, and legendary). Upgrade your pickaxe for faster mining and bigger digs, and expand your inventory to carry more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/4e284ba77057e6412ed17caeeaa89a8a.poster.avif?t=1769775461\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/4e284ba77057e6412ed17caeeaa89a8a.webm?t=1769775461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/4e284ba77057e6412ed17caeeaa89a8a.mp4?t=1769775461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/68034ec570155bfa2a5acc21b1380877.avif?t=1769775461\" width=609 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle monsters in turn-based combat throughout the dungeon. Enemies drop gold, essence, and special items to enhance your gear. Unlock new drops with essence and power up your equipment to take on tougher enemies and bosses. After defeating your first boss you can prestige, unlock permanent buffs and repeat the cycle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/8279228ea086c9562dd57b62e8e9c06b.poster.avif?t=1769775461\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/8279228ea086c9562dd57b62e8e9c06b.webm?t=1769775461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/8279228ea086c9562dd57b62e8e9c06b.mp4?t=1769775461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832880?t=1769775461","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/1c78d31bfd8b77591037f6682852de88dfc38c74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769775461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/b837fe52d21bebbb5bc92cc6570af95bdbc6101a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769775461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/b837fe52d21bebbb5bc92cc6570af95bdbc6101a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769775461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4204260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the grind</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, Craft, Kill. This is the path to the bottom. Dig for resources, craft powerful gear, kill enemies for loot and overcome bosses to be able to prestige, unlock permanent buffs and repeat. See how far you can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/38c14f0cb9abfd2e35d9c9e57d7131c9.avif?t=1769775461\" width=609 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five unique dig sites, each with different ores to mine for crafting better gear. Defeat dungeon bosses to unlock new locations, and spend gold dropped from monsters to regenerate dig sites for endless resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/extras/a27